ry_text\",\"text\":\"**Refining channel close and shutdown cleanup**\"}]}"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_BOyZBRhF4zuFzmz87Fe7hZ3U|fc_0672f30ea9308838016ad13cd8ab1c87d1893b0c58f6093c56", "name": "edit", "arguments": {"path": "tests/src/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/src/test/java/org_apache_pulsar/pulsar_client_all/NioDatagramChannelConfigTest.java", "edits": [{"oldText": "import java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.socket.DatagramChannelConfig;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.socket.nio.NioDatagramChannel;\n", "newText": "import java.nio.channels.DatagramChannel;\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.socket.DatagramChannelConfig;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.socket.nio.NioDatagramChannel;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoopGroup;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.util.concurrent.Future;\n"}, {"oldText": "    void readsAndWritesMulticastSocketOptions() {\n        NioDatagramChannel channel = new NioDatagramChannel();\n        try {\n            DatagramChannelConfig config = channel.config();\n            config.setTimeToLive(8);\n            config.setLoopbackModeDisabled(false);\n\n            assertThat(config.getTimeToLive()).isEqualTo(8);\n            assertThat(config.isLoopbackModeDisabled()).isFalse();\n        } finally {\n            channel.close().awaitUninterruptibly(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n        }\n        assertThat(channel.isOpen()).isFalse();\n    }\n}", "newText": "    void readsAndWritesMulticastSocketOptions() throws Exception {\n        DatagramChannel socket = DatagramChannel.open();\n        NioDatagramChannel channel = new NioDatagramChannel(socket);\n        NioEventLoopGroup eventLoopGroup = new NioEventLoopGroup(1);\n        try {\n            awaitSuccess(eventLoopGroup.register(channel), 10);\n            DatagramChannelConfig config = channel.config();\n            config.setTimeToLive(8);\n            config.setLoopbackModeDisabled(false);\n\n            assertThat(config.getTimeToLive()).isEqualTo(8);\n            assertThat(config.isLoopbackModeDisabled()).isFalse();\n        } finally {\n            try {\n                if (channel.isRegistered()) {\n                    awaitSuccess(channel.close(), 10);\n                }\n            } finally {\n                socket.close();\n                awaitSuccess(eventLoopGroup.shutdownGracefully(0, 10, TimeUnit.SECONDS), 20);\n            }\n        }\n        assertThat(channel.isOpen()).isFalse();\n    }\n\n    private static void awaitSuccess(Future<?> future, long timeoutSeconds) {\n        assertThat(future.awaitUninterruptibly(timeoutSeconds, TimeUnit.SECONDS)).isTrue();\n        assertThat(future.isSuccess()).isTrue();\n    }\n}"}]}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1810, "output": 1551, "cacheRead": 203648, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 917, "totalTokens": 207009, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1792097476737, "responseId": "resp_0672f30ea9308838016ad13cc551a487d1a37ea96ba83d0a79", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_BOyZBRhF4zuFzmz87Fe7hZ3U|fc_0672f30ea9308838016ad13cd8ab1c87d1893b0c58f6093c56", "toolName": "edit", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully replaced 2 block(s) in tests/src/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/src/test/java/org_apache_pulsar/pulsar_client_all/NioDatagramChannelConfigTest.java."}], "details": {"diff": "    ...\n  7 package org_apache_pulsar.pulsar_client_all;\n  8 \n  9 import static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n 10 \n+11 import java.nio.channels.DatagramChannel;\n 11 import java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n 12 import org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.channel.socket.DatagramChannelConfig